      "10": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "PITCH TO FREQUENCY\n\nThis node converts a pitch (most commonly from MIDI note) and converts it to a frequency in Hertz.\n\nIn this patch we use this node to create a frequency for our Sine oscillator. The higher the pitch, the faster the frequency.\nAn A4 node would be 440hz and in would end up as a frequency of 4.4 hz for our oscillaotr (see the divide node). "
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 196,
          "width": 500,
